Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.19,0:00:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.67,0:00:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.85,0:00:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going in too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we should find out what\Nkind of boss we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How else are we gonna\Nfigure out how to beat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just...
