Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard to have about 10 shield users.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shield users, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What's wrong? You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hiding something, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:02:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.35,0:03:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The biggest advantage of using a one-handed\Nsword is you can also use a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever\Nseen you using one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't use a shield because\Nit'll slow down my rapier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.03,0:03:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Others don't because\Nthey think it looks dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how come you're not using the\Nsword you commissioned from Liz?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's rude to ask people\Nto justify their skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it's gotten so late,\Nmight as well have lunch here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you make it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, but you better take your\Ngloves off before you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you get it to taste so amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chalk it up to a whole\Nyear of training and study.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.13,0:04:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aincrad has everything you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's about a hundred\Ndifferent seasonings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.59,0:04:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made everything just\Nby calculating all the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.03,0:04:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,parameters used by the\NFlavor Recreation Engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was made with grokwa seed,\Nshugra leaf, and calum water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mayonnaise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I made this using abilba seed,\Nsag leaves, and oolah fish bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tastes exactly like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.91,0:04:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soy sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.59,0:04:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made the sauce for the\Nsandwich out of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing! It's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you thought about selling\Nthis? You'd make a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.37,0:04:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it's that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can't sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there wouldn't be any left for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:04:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god, you're so greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you like it that much,\NI could always make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How you doing, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still alive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're the same as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're a solo player.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing with a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.13,0:05:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn you guys met\Nbefore at one of the boss fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Klein of the Furinkazan Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is Asuna of the\NKnights of the Blood Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lagging?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 24 and single and looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really mad, Asuna? Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't know about Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's payback, you weasel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holding out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal, man? Spill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.99,0:06:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito and I are together\Nbecause we're sort of in a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.57,0:06:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, you son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the big guild that runs floor one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.81,0:07:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were almost slaughtered on Floor 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of clearing levels, they've\Nbeen trying to build up their numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen them on the\Nfront lines in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.45,0:07:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with the Aincrad Liberation Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.99,0:07:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Colonel Corvats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Kirito, Solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you cleared the area up ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also got a map with\Ndirections to the boss room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then hand over that map\Nand we'll be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.37,0:07:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want us to just give it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You even know how much of a\Npain in the ass mapping is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We share our information and resources\Nwith civilian players all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we don't charge a thing for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We maintain order in the\Nchaos of battle so that all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:08:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,players can leave this world\Nas quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, it's your duty to cooperate\Nwith us, so hand over that map!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we got back to town, I was going\Nto go public with the map anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cool. Oh, now wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, you're\Nbeing way too nice to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about making\Nmoney off map data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, thanks for cooperating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, if you're planning to hit\Nthe boss, I wouldn't recommend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is my decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just took a look\Ninside that room, pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.05,0:08:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you can't beat that boss\Nif your troops are half dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at them, they're exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonsense, my men are tougher than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't quit until I say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your feet, come on, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those guys going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they know what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't rush the boss without\Nchecking it out first, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.01,0:09:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should keep an eye on him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who's nicer, you or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.91,0:09:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, anyway, Asuna,\NI got a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can be hard to talk to,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he's a loner and addicted\Nto combat, but he's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of him, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise, he's in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only thing left's the boss's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe those guys used some kind of\Nteleportation thingy to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.27,0:10:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your teleport crystals! We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crystals aren't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.57,0:10:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a trap like\Nthis being in a boss room before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Uncrant Liberation Army\Ndoesn't know the word retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:10:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting! They're insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.87,0:11:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't use their\Nteleportation crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could distract the boss, but\Ngoing in there is too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But isn't there something we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.61,0:11:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Korvats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.81,0:12:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll take forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there! Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.37,0:13:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to end this is if I use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.11,0:13:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just use it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Klein! Asuna! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need ten seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep him off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:13:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Switch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.65,0:14:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starburst stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of skill is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.71,0:15:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.31,0:16:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long was I out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.81,0:16:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, don't hug me so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lose the last of my HP.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Korvats and two of his men are\Nthe only ones who didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't lost a player in\Na boss fight since Floor 67.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a boss fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kovats was a damn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point to\Nany of this if you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.21,0:17:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not off the hook either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.59,0:17:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an extra skill I picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dual wielding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, are there prerequisites?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I knew that, I'd have shared it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not on the Infobroker skill list.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it's exclusive to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got a unique skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to stay on the down low, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you keep an awesome secret\Nlike this from your buddies?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About six months ago, I was scrolling\Nthrough my skill menu, and it was just...
