Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd get pissed because you\Nhad something they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.75,0:18:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some gamers are like that, but not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People would definitely\Nbe jealous you had that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.67,0:18:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they say your character's\Nbuilt by life's challenges,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so keep soldiering on, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go trigger the warp gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need to rest for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.98,0:18:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.91,0:18:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how you ran in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To rescue those army guys like you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, I'm glad you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.05,0:19:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you died, I didn't know what I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.45,0:19:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who jumped\Nin first, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking a leave of absence from the\Nguild. Why? And do what? Sleep in all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.81,0:19:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I was teaming up with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.95,0:19:28.16,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\pos(721,927)\c&H939898&\blur0.9\fs45}has invited you to join her party.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.16,0:19:28.79,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA2ACAD&\blur0.9\fs45\pos(844.995,397.005)\frz351}has invited you to join her party.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.79,0:19:28.83,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA2ACAD&\blur0.9\fs37.5\frz351\pos(883.005,394.995)}has invited you to join her party.
