Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A blue demon that annihilated a\Nbig squad of army guys and a 50
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.97,0:20:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-hit combo from a dual wielder\Nwho took out the boss by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what a big deal\Nthey're making out of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's blowing up right in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A buttload of swordsmen and info brokers\Nshowed up at my place this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I need a new pad because\Nthey know where I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, that's sort\Nof kind of your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it was going\Nto be our little secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you went and blabbed it to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.49,0:20:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got ourselves a huge\Nproblem outside of boss fights.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.70,0:20:57.71,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,500)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(981,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H1F1F22&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}October {\fscx100}19{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}    {\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Granzam
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.70,0:20:57.71,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,500)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(981,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H1F1F22&\blur3\fs72\alpha&45}October {\fscx100}19{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}    {\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Granzam
Dialogue: 2,0:20:52.70,0:20:57.71,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,500)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(979.5,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&}October {\fscx100}19{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}    {\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Granzam
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe we've ever actually met.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.91,0:21:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well there was that conference on\Nfloor 67 we talked a little bit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.81,0:21:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander Heathcliff, yes, that\Nwas a difficult battle, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.07,0:21:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We almost lost a few players there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.61,0:21:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may be the top guild, but we barely\Nget by with the amount of troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.23,0:21:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have and now here you are trying\Nto poach one of our best players.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.87,0:21:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if she's that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should do a better\Njob picking her bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my sincerest apologies for any\Ntrouble you might have had with Kuradeel,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.09,0:21:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you must understand\Nthat we simply cannot allow
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our second in command to leave\Nthe guild just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.43,0:21:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want her, you'll have to use\Nyour dual blades to take her from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can defeat me in combat you'll\Nbe free to take Asuna with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other hand if you lose you will\Njoin the Knights of the Blood Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:22:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah okay, if you want to settle\Nthis with swords that's fine by me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.33,0:22:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have ourselves a duel then.
